AC families locked per plan-doc §4:

  - AC.FBMT1.SUPM.1 — `superseded-by: <relative-path>` parses;
    value exposed on parsed memory-file representation.
  - AC.FBMT1.SUPM.2 — Retrieval ranker demotes superseded files
